s to the AI source make a mixed-origin frame; retain its lineage. No planted contact anchor while airborne.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]},{\"id\":\"walk-head\",\"title\":\"Refine independent walk heads\",\"category\":\"walk\",\"priority\":\"normal\",\"tags\":[\"walk\",\"head-bob\"],\"instructions\":\"Review the high/low head combinations. Improve the head/neck seam if needed while leaving leg frames and every planted paw marker unchanged. Compare original and half-time head bobbing at the same walking speed.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]},{\"id\":\"sitting-glance\",\"title\":\"Sitting head glance\",\"category\":\"idle\",\"priority\":\"later\",\"tags\":[\"sit\",\"look\"],\"instructions\":\"Explore a small head turn toward a nearby object without flipping the whole body. Audit the existing turn/idle catalogue before drawing new pixels; keep bearing paws in their source cells.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]}]},\"catalogueRevision\":4,\"preferredFrame\":0,\"importedSavedAt\":\"2026-10-14T21:20:09.484Z\",\"wip\":false}}","etag":"2a2a2109ae90b718de84039d4a09906d893e8e89e49f9421c87281f531fb63cb","customMetadata":{"projectId":"8cf69cf1-de43-48a8-bc9e-c212c3cf8b33","name":"Walking · faster - DELETE THIS VERSION","savedAt":"2026-10-15T07:55:33.143Z","ready":"0"}}